    // Refunding an uncharged fragment tail grants credit against later parser-owned text.
    'for (const [first, second, decoded] of [["x", "y", "xy"], [String.fromCharCode(0xd83d), String.fromCharCode(0xde00), String.fromCharCode(0xd83d, 0xde00)], ["\\\\uD83D", "\\\\uDE00", String.fromCharCode(0xd83d, 0xde00)], [String.fromCharCode(0xd83d), "", String.fromCharCode(0xd83d)]]) {',
